WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.800
=Episode 33=

01:35.350 --> 01:35.870
Your Majesty,

01:36.509 --> 01:37.190
Maningbu

01:37.430 --> 01:38.470
is an envoy of Wutuo.

01:38.830 --> 01:39.670
I suggest we

01:40.229 --> 01:41.070
detain him

01:41.470 --> 01:43.030
at the embassy

01:43.990 --> 01:45.390
and write to the King of Wutuo,

01:45.750 --> 01:46.870
stating his crimes.

01:47.190 --> 01:48.390
His disposition rests solely

01:49.030 --> 01:50.670
on the King of Wutuo's response.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.210
Go.

01:58.190 --> 01:59.150
Strip the He family

02:02.950 --> 02:03.990
of their noble titles.

02:04.390 --> 02:05.150
He Yuansheng

02:05.430 --> 02:06.790
will be exiled to the border.

02:09.870 --> 02:10.550
Marquis Wu'an.

02:11.110 --> 02:12.870
Technically, you're from the He family.

02:13.950 --> 02:14.630
Your family

02:15.030 --> 02:15.950
disguised you as a son.

02:15.950 --> 02:16.829
You've also committed

02:17.310 --> 02:17.990
a capital crime.

02:18.430 --> 02:18.950
Your Majesty,

02:19.870 --> 02:20.590
He Yan never had

02:20.590 --> 02:21.630
the right to choose.

02:22.230 --> 02:23.430
She didn't mean to deceive

02:24.070 --> 02:25.030
Your Majesty.

02:25.350 --> 02:25.870
Your Majesty,

02:26.230 --> 02:27.470
Commander Xiao is right.

02:27.829 --> 02:28.710
Besides, Marquis Wu'an

02:28.910 --> 02:30.150
is an exceptional talent

02:30.430 --> 02:31.870
who has repeatedly

02:32.150 --> 02:33.710
defeated Wutuo's armies

02:34.110 --> 02:35.110
and defended the nation.

02:35.350 --> 02:37.230
I implore Your Majesty's mercy.

02:37.990 --> 02:39.150
But even so,

02:39.630 --> 02:40.510
she wasn't entirely

02:40.710 --> 02:42.110
ignorant about this matter.

02:42.710 --> 02:43.910
Instead of behaving,

02:44.310 --> 02:45.470
she chose to enlist.

02:45.950 --> 02:47.110
Doesn't she know

02:47.430 --> 02:48.829
this compounds her crimes?

02:49.390 --> 02:50.550
Don't tell me

02:50.990 --> 02:51.910
you joined the army

02:52.350 --> 02:54.110
solely out of patriotism.

02:54.670 --> 02:55.990
Not entirely.

02:59.670 --> 03:00.310
Your Majesty.

03:01.030 --> 03:01.830
One day,

03:02.190 --> 03:03.590
I overheard my father

03:03.680 --> 03:04.830
arranging a marriage for me.

03:05.190 --> 03:06.150
So I fled home.

03:06.790 --> 03:08.910
Meanwhile, becoming a great general

03:09.070 --> 03:10.510
had always been my aspiration.

03:10.990 --> 03:12.230
So I went straight to enlist

03:12.510 --> 03:13.630
without hesitation.

03:14.110 --> 03:15.310
Why did you enlist again

03:15.390 --> 03:16.630
after you survived death?

03:16.990 --> 03:18.590
Were you waiting for this day

03:19.070 --> 03:20.230
to seek revenge?

03:20.350 --> 03:20.950
Your Majesty,

03:21.470 --> 03:22.510
she never intended that.

03:22.670 --> 03:23.750
Let her speak for herself.

03:29.630 --> 03:30.150
Your Majesty,

03:31.030 --> 03:31.750
I do

03:32.070 --> 03:33.550
resent their cruelty,

03:33.990 --> 03:34.750
but after all,

03:35.190 --> 03:36.870
they raised me for many years.

03:37.510 --> 03:38.829
I'm no longer in debt

03:39.310 --> 03:41.110
after what has happened to me.

03:41.470 --> 03:42.710
I don't want revenge.

03:43.070 --> 03:43.829
Besides,

03:43.870 --> 03:45.190
what would revenge accomplish?

03:45.510 --> 03:46.630
I only wanted

03:46.870 --> 03:48.070
to reclaim my true identity.

03:48.430 --> 03:49.790
That's why I rejoined the army.

03:50.110 --> 03:50.990
If I hadn't

03:51.390 --> 03:52.110
uncovered

03:52.110 --> 03:53.110
the conspiracy

03:53.950 --> 03:54.630
and decided

03:55.350 --> 03:56.829
to seek justice for my deceased

03:57.030 --> 03:57.870
fellow soldiers,

03:58.470 --> 03:59.470
I would have remained

03:59.710 --> 04:01.230
as He Yan of Yezhou Garrison,

04:01.550 --> 04:02.550
who would

04:03.310 --> 04:03.990
eventually die

04:03.990 --> 04:05.470
as Female General He Yan of Wei.

04:11.230 --> 04:11.870
Your Majesty,

04:12.150 --> 04:13.150
He Yan's merits outweigh

04:13.750 --> 04:14.790
her minor mistakes.

04:15.270 --> 04:16.230
She defended our borders

04:16.950 --> 04:17.829
and martial dignity

04:18.430 --> 04:19.589
at the Fuyue Army.

04:20.149 --> 04:21.149
At Yezhou Garrison,

04:21.390 --> 04:22.390
she went around

04:22.510 --> 04:23.590
to defend our territory.

04:24.110 --> 04:24.870
It proves that

04:25.590 --> 04:27.390
her military resolve has never wavered.

04:27.950 --> 04:29.070
Her loyalty to Wei

04:29.150 --> 04:30.310
remains steadfast.

04:31.150 --> 04:31.950
Your Majesty,

04:32.390 --> 04:34.190
given her unwavering loyalty to you

04:34.550 --> 04:35.510
and her dedication

04:35.590 --> 04:36.790
to serving Wei,

04:38.670 --> 04:39.830
please show mercy.

04:42.110 --> 04:42.670
Your Majesty,

04:42.870 --> 04:44.150
Commander Xiao is right.

04:44.790 --> 04:45.390
Marquis Wu'an

04:45.670 --> 04:46.510
helped Your Majesty

04:46.750 --> 04:48.070
purge corrupt officials

04:48.350 --> 04:49.190
today in court.

04:49.550 --> 04:51.310
Why not offset merits against faults

04:51.470 --> 04:52.270
to demonstrate

04:52.470 --> 04:53.670
your appreciation for talent

04:53.870 --> 04:54.630
and your wisdom

04:54.909 --> 04:56.870
in just rewards and punishments?

04:58.950 --> 05:00.790
What do you say, my ministers?

05:05.310 --> 05:06.030
Your Majesty,

05:06.790 --> 05:07.670
I believe

05:07.670 --> 05:09.390
that General Fengyun and Mr. Chu

05:09.430 --> 05:10.510
make valid arguments.

05:10.950 --> 05:11.670
Marquis Wu'an

05:11.830 --> 05:13.470
is truly an exceptional general.

05:13.830 --> 05:15.150
Now that the truth is revealed,

05:15.510 --> 05:17.950
General He should be reinstated

05:18.110 --> 05:19.390
to revive the Fuyue Army.

05:19.910 --> 05:20.470
Moreover,

05:20.990 --> 05:22.470
with the truth revealed,

05:22.790 --> 05:23.830
I propose

05:24.190 --> 05:25.670
rehabilitating the Xiao family

05:25.870 --> 05:27.310
to stabilize military morale.

05:35.270 --> 05:36.030
You've rushed

05:36.070 --> 05:37.870
to say all the good things.

05:38.990 --> 05:39.750
Rest assured.

05:40.270 --> 05:41.430
I was merely jesting.

05:41.630 --> 05:42.140
Of course,

05:42.310 --> 05:44.470
I won't let my loyal ministers down.

05:45.270 --> 05:45.870
Mr. Xiao,

05:46.310 --> 05:48.310
I will draft an edict shortly

05:48.510 --> 05:51.470
to rehabilitate
the Xiao family and the Xiao Army.

05:58.190 --> 05:59.830
Thank you, Your Majesty.

06:03.070 --> 06:03.870
Marquis Wu'an,

06:04.350 --> 06:06.070
you are no less capable than any man.

06:06.270 --> 06:07.870
Resume your title as General Feihong.

06:08.030 --> 06:08.790
I hope you

06:09.070 --> 06:11.150
could uphold Wei's military honor,

06:11.310 --> 06:12.670
guard our borders,

06:12.830 --> 06:14.190
and protect our people.

06:14.750 --> 06:15.350
Understood.

06:15.990 --> 06:16.590
Thank you,

06:16.950 --> 06:17.670
Your Majesty.

06:20.910 --> 06:21.510
Chu Zhao,

06:21.870 --> 06:23.190
you helped the generals

06:23.390 --> 06:24.710
with Xu Jingfu's case.

06:25.030 --> 06:25.910
You did a good job.

06:26.950 --> 06:28.230
I hereby make you

06:28.790 --> 06:30.190
Vice Director of the Secretariat.

06:33.150 --> 06:34.110
Thank you, Your Majesty.

06:44.430 --> 06:45.430
Let me go.

06:45.750 --> 06:46.950
You can't arrest me.

06:47.590 --> 06:49.760
(General Feihong's Mansion)
My son is General Feihong.

06:49.760 --> 06:50.430
Hurry!

06:50.430 --> 06:51.470
Let me go!

06:52.750 --> 06:55.070
My daughter is Marquis Wu'an!

06:55.350 --> 06:56.030
Master.

06:56.150 --> 06:58.630
You can't take me.

06:58.740 --> 07:02.780
(Sealed by Wei's
Department of State Affairs)

07:02.960 --> 07:06.270
(General Feihong's Mansion)

07:06.270 --> 07:08.450
(Sealed by Wei's
Department of State Affairs)

07:09.230 --> 07:09.760
Move.

07:11.270 --> 07:11.900
Hurry up.

07:12.910 --> 07:13.470
Go.

07:14.190 --> 07:15.030
How dare you!

07:15.230 --> 07:16.380
My father is the Chancellor.

07:16.710 --> 07:17.630
Show some respect.

07:17.910 --> 07:19.230
Do you know who I am?

07:19.430 --> 07:20.950
All of you, get out!

07:22.670 --> 07:23.230
Step aside.

07:23.510 --> 07:24.390
That's my chest.

07:25.270 --> 07:25.790
Get lost.

07:29.870 --> 07:31.390
You... My maids.

07:31.430 --> 07:31.990
Let them go.

07:31.990 --> 07:32.510
Move aside.

07:33.710 --> 07:34.430
Miss.

07:40.350 --> 07:41.150
Don't take that.

07:41.150 --> 07:42.550
Those are my father's favorites.

07:42.550 --> 07:43.330
Let go.

07:45.790 --> 07:46.830
Listen, Miss Xu.

07:49.110 --> 07:49.670
Let go.

07:50.350 --> 07:52.270
Xu Jingfu's been thrown into prison,

07:52.710 --> 07:54.350
and your property is confiscated.

07:54.790 --> 07:55.909
Do you still think

07:55.950 --> 07:57.790
you're the chancellor's daughter?

07:58.190 --> 07:58.750
He used to

07:58.790 --> 08:00.430
boss us around.

08:00.630 --> 08:01.430
Meanwhile,

08:01.590 --> 08:03.510
he conspired with enemies.

08:04.030 --> 08:05.870
He deserves no chancellor title.

08:06.670 --> 08:07.310
Nonsense.

08:07.670 --> 08:09.830
My father will punish you.

08:10.150 --> 08:11.190
Miss Xu,

08:11.470 --> 08:13.630
if Mr. Chu hadn't been kind enough

08:13.710 --> 08:15.470
to plead your case to His Majesty,

08:15.750 --> 08:16.910
do you think

08:17.030 --> 08:19.070
you'd still be bossing us around?

08:19.310 --> 08:21.630
You would've been sent to a brothel.

08:22.270 --> 08:23.110
Nonsense.

08:27.030 --> 08:27.670
You...

08:28.830 --> 08:29.340
You...

08:29.790 --> 08:30.630
Stay away from me.

08:31.470 --> 08:32.390
Stay away from me.

08:32.429 --> 08:33.020
Miss.

08:34.549 --> 08:35.230
Mr. Chu.

08:40.110 --> 08:40.990
Mr. Chu, I apologize.

08:41.110 --> 08:41.830
I apologize.

08:42.190 --> 08:44.110
I apologize.

08:48.390 --> 08:48.910
Hurry.

08:49.670 --> 08:51.110
Arrest them all.

08:51.470 --> 08:52.470
Punish them!

08:55.350 --> 08:56.430
Why aren't you speaking?

08:57.150 --> 08:57.750
Could it be...?

08:59.470 --> 09:00.870
Could it be that what they said...

09:02.430 --> 09:03.230
is true?

09:06.270 --> 09:07.030
No way.

09:07.950 --> 09:08.630
No way.

09:09.670 --> 09:10.550
They...

09:11.390 --> 09:12.630
They framed my father.

09:13.790 --> 09:14.590
I'll kill them.

09:14.990 --> 09:16.110
I'll kill them.

09:16.790 --> 09:17.310
Pingting.

09:17.630 --> 09:18.550
Calm down, Pingting.

09:18.630 --> 09:20.270
Kill them for me.

09:20.310 --> 09:21.790
Your father would be worried.

09:23.110 --> 09:24.310
Why are you still here?

09:25.070 --> 09:26.510
Get my father out now.

09:26.550 --> 09:27.950
Alright, I promise you.

09:28.270 --> 09:28.870
Don't worry.

09:29.110 --> 09:29.670
I'll bring

09:29.670 --> 09:30.590
your father back.

09:30.870 --> 09:32.150
They're here for work.

09:32.390 --> 09:33.630
Come with me first.

09:33.710 --> 09:34.270
Alright?

09:34.270 --> 09:35.190
Why should I leave?

09:35.950 --> 09:37.070
This is my home.

09:37.470 --> 09:38.190
Make them...

09:39.310 --> 09:40.110
Make them...

09:40.710 --> 09:42.750
Make them get out of here.

09:44.550 --> 09:45.670
I'm worried about you.

09:46.270 --> 09:47.310
Your father isn't here.

09:47.510 --> 09:48.470
You're alone.

09:48.710 --> 09:49.870
I couldn't be at ease.

09:50.590 --> 09:52.030
Then I couldn't focus on

09:52.230 --> 09:53.390
getting Master out.

09:53.790 --> 09:54.590
Come with me.

09:54.750 --> 09:55.390
Okay?

09:57.550 --> 09:58.110
Alright.

09:59.110 --> 10:01.070
I... I'll go with you.

10:01.390 --> 10:03.350
I... I won't distract you.

10:04.590 --> 10:05.310
Please,

10:05.750 --> 10:07.070
bring my father back.

10:07.150 --> 10:07.950
Alright.

10:08.350 --> 10:09.310
Sorry for the trouble.

10:09.950 --> 10:10.950
I'll take her away.

10:11.870 --> 10:12.830
- Understood.
- Understood.

10:15.390 --> 10:15.950
Let's go.

10:22.840 --> 10:26.040
(Chu Mansion)

10:35.230 --> 10:36.030
Miss Xu.

10:36.630 --> 10:38.230
This is the guest room for you.

10:38.790 --> 10:39.550
If you need

10:39.550 --> 10:40.430
anything,

10:40.750 --> 10:42.150
feel free to tell me.

10:44.590 --> 10:45.390
Arrest all those

10:45.430 --> 10:46.230
who framed

10:46.270 --> 10:47.070
my father

10:47.230 --> 10:48.310
and bring my father back.

10:48.790 --> 10:50.030
Once he's out,

10:50.390 --> 10:51.070
we can start

10:51.070 --> 10:52.150
planning our wedding.

10:52.310 --> 10:52.950
Don't worry.

10:53.390 --> 10:55.150
I'll find a way to save your father.

10:55.830 --> 10:56.390
Pingting.

10:57.390 --> 10:58.430
Settle in for now.

10:59.430 --> 11:00.310
Miss Xu.

11:02.030 --> 11:02.710
Please go ahead.

11:05.110 --> 11:05.710
Alright.

11:25.390 --> 11:26.030
Your Majesty.

11:26.910 --> 11:28.870
My master shows no remorse

11:29.230 --> 11:29.990
for his crimes.

11:30.710 --> 11:31.870
Please allow me

11:32.190 --> 11:33.430
to visit the prison

11:33.630 --> 11:34.990
and bid him farewell

11:36.030 --> 11:37.190
after the final trial.

11:39.630 --> 11:41.230
And my master's daughter Xu Pingting

11:41.910 --> 11:43.350
knows nothing about his deeds.

11:43.630 --> 11:45.270
Please show mercy, Your Majesty.

12:11.590 --> 12:13.230
You never liked Miss Xu.

12:14.830 --> 12:16.190
Why did you plead for her?

12:17.710 --> 12:18.790
You're inviting trouble.

12:20.390 --> 12:21.470
Master is arrested,

12:21.510 --> 12:22.190
awaiting trials.

12:23.190 --> 12:24.310
His followers will surely

12:24.510 --> 12:25.630
stir things up

12:26.030 --> 12:26.790
in the court.

12:27.750 --> 12:28.550
I am protecting

12:28.950 --> 12:29.870
Xu Pingting

12:30.630 --> 12:32.030
to keep those people calm.

12:32.550 --> 12:34.030
They'll remain compliant

12:34.470 --> 12:35.430
for their own sake.

12:36.150 --> 12:36.670
Besides,

12:39.830 --> 12:41.670
my mother died in despair

12:43.070 --> 12:44.750
because no one offered her help.

13:05.630 --> 13:06.630
Did you get hurt?

13:09.190 --> 13:10.310
Mother.

13:11.390 --> 13:12.110
Yan.

13:17.230 --> 13:18.070
Mother.

13:20.030 --> 13:20.910
Mother.

13:31.670 --> 13:32.310
Mother.

13:33.990 --> 13:34.870
Mother.

13:37.190 --> 13:38.150
Mother!

13:48.820 --> 13:52.470
(Late Mother, Tang Jia)

14:03.310 --> 14:03.990
He Yan.

14:06.390 --> 14:07.310
Xiao Jue.

14:12.910 --> 14:14.510
I've lost my mother.

14:18.670 --> 14:19.830
I no longer

14:22.990 --> 14:24.550
have a mother.

14:28.560 --> 14:34.660
♪Endless gazing.
Step by step, falling deeper♪

14:36.790 --> 14:37.750
Cry if you need to.

14:39.710 --> 14:40.510
I'm here for you.

14:45.070 --> 14:46.430
She named me

14:47.310 --> 14:48.350
He Yan.

14:52.950 --> 14:54.350
She hoped

14:56.510 --> 14:57.950
I could be

15:00.350 --> 15:02.590
a carefree and happy girl all my life.

15:04.600 --> 15:08.790
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

15:08.950 --> 15:11.510
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

15:11.510 --> 15:12.990
She wanted to care for me,

15:14.670 --> 15:16.110
but because of my father,

15:17.110 --> 15:18.430
she kept her distance.

15:19.950 --> 15:21.670
She put up with it her entire life.

15:24.590 --> 15:25.790
Why

15:28.110 --> 15:29.110
couldn't she

15:29.230 --> 15:30.630
keep enduring?

15:34.270 --> 15:38.300
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

15:38.750 --> 15:39.670
She loved you.

15:42.350 --> 15:43.790
She wanted you to live well.

15:43.920 --> 15:48.990
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

16:05.070 --> 16:05.870
Don't worry.

16:06.270 --> 16:07.150
I'm alright now.

16:12.630 --> 16:13.430
It turns out

16:13.550 --> 16:14.270
that He is

16:14.270 --> 16:15.510
the real General Feihong.

16:15.870 --> 16:16.470
No wonder

16:16.510 --> 16:17.710
neither of you

16:17.870 --> 16:18.630
could beat her.

16:18.790 --> 16:20.270
Why would you bring up

16:20.270 --> 16:21.470
such unpleasant topics?

16:21.590 --> 16:23.030
Wang, why are you glaring at me?

16:23.550 --> 16:24.870
Losing to General Feihong

16:25.150 --> 16:25.850
isn't shameful.

16:27.070 --> 16:27.790
W-Well,

16:27.950 --> 16:29.710
it's not shameful,

16:29.910 --> 16:30.460
but...

16:33.350 --> 16:34.470
Why are you here?

16:34.550 --> 16:36.910
W-We came with the Nine...

16:37.280 --> 16:38.210
Nine Banners Battalion.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.590
Nine Banners Battalion?

16:40.070 --> 16:41.030
After Rundu,

16:41.230 --> 16:41.990
Commander Xiao

16:41.990 --> 16:42.910
enlisted all of us.

16:43.110 --> 16:44.670
If your Fuyue Army is recruiting,

16:44.990 --> 16:46.110
we'll pack immediately

16:46.150 --> 16:46.790
and join you.

16:54.030 --> 16:55.670
They're my comrades.

16:55.830 --> 16:56.710
Be nice.

16:56.910 --> 16:57.510
They're also

16:57.510 --> 16:58.670
my soldiers.

17:00.110 --> 17:00.670
Anyway,

17:00.950 --> 17:01.590
thank you.

17:02.710 --> 17:04.750
W-We are...

17:05.150 --> 17:06.310
- Buddies.
- Buddies.

17:06.869 --> 17:07.950
You're buddies.

17:08.349 --> 17:09.710
Are we excluded?

17:10.470 --> 17:11.790
So you had it all planned

17:12.510 --> 17:13.349
and didn't tell me.

17:14.069 --> 17:15.550
Luckily, I recognized Feinu.

17:16.030 --> 17:16.710
Otherwise,

17:17.030 --> 17:18.430
I would've been fooled.

17:26.030 --> 17:26.990
You couldn't tell?

17:27.670 --> 17:28.750
So you're truly a fool.

17:29.150 --> 17:29.830
Xiao Jue.

17:30.270 --> 17:31.710
You haven't changed at all.

17:32.270 --> 17:33.150
Keep defending her.

17:35.870 --> 17:37.110
You were kept in the dark too.

17:37.350 --> 17:37.950
Say something.

17:39.430 --> 17:40.310
The Fuyue Army

17:40.390 --> 17:41.150
will always fulfill

17:41.390 --> 17:41.950
the orders

17:41.950 --> 17:42.950
of General Feihong.

17:49.710 --> 17:51.470
You are magnanimous, General Yan.

17:51.590 --> 17:52.630
Please forgive us.

17:55.150 --> 17:55.740
Forget it.

17:56.110 --> 17:57.110
I am magnanimous.

17:58.430 --> 18:01.030
Give me 10 jin of prenatal tonic

18:01.070 --> 18:02.350
for Xiu.

18:02.790 --> 18:03.630
Then we're cool.

18:04.270 --> 18:05.150
Ten jin?

18:05.870 --> 18:06.500
Yeah.

18:07.870 --> 18:08.670
I can keep

18:09.070 --> 18:10.350
the leftovers for next time.

18:11.150 --> 18:12.070
Ten jin it is.

18:12.390 --> 18:13.230
Consider it done.

18:15.150 --> 18:17.270
Thank you, Mr. Cheng.

18:18.230 --> 18:18.870
Yan.

18:19.070 --> 18:20.110
Why would you ask him?

18:20.390 --> 18:21.070
I got this.

18:21.390 --> 18:21.950
Yan.

18:22.150 --> 18:23.750
So you're General Feihong.

18:23.910 --> 18:25.150
I truly admire you.

18:27.030 --> 18:27.680
Commander.

18:30.710 --> 18:31.310
The edict came.

18:35.190 --> 18:36.870
(Imperial Edict)
His Majesty

18:37.150 --> 18:37.910
decrees

18:38.750 --> 18:41.030
that Xiao Zhongwu,
commander of the Xiao Army,

18:41.630 --> 18:42.830
demonstrated loyalty

18:43.190 --> 18:44.430
and diligence.

18:44.670 --> 18:47.350
He dedicated himself to the nation

18:47.790 --> 18:49.030
until his last breath.

18:49.190 --> 18:51.150
Yet he was framed
by treacherous officials

18:51.270 --> 18:52.670
and suffered injustice.

18:52.950 --> 18:54.510
With the villain brought to justice,

18:54.750 --> 18:56.070
his name is cleared.

18:56.510 --> 18:57.230
I hereby confer

18:57.550 --> 19:00.230
Xiao Zhongwu the title of
Loyal and Valiant General.

19:00.790 --> 19:03.350
A proper reburial rite
shall be conducted to honor him.

19:03.950 --> 19:04.470
Furthermore,

19:04.590 --> 19:06.790
General Fengyun, Xiao Jue,
shall be promoted

19:07.230 --> 19:08.790
as commander of the Xiao Army

19:08.910 --> 19:11.030
to restore its military prestige.

19:11.550 --> 19:12.870
By Imperial Decree.

19:14.990 --> 19:16.710
- We thank His Majesty.
- We thank His Majesty.

19:31.790 --> 19:34.070
Today, the world will learn about

19:34.590 --> 19:36.350
the injustice you've suffered.

19:37.350 --> 19:39.990
This edict was scheduled to be delivered

19:40.110 --> 19:41.910
by the Chief Eunuch in person.

19:43.070 --> 19:44.630
But I thought you'd be

19:44.750 --> 19:45.990
anticipating.

19:46.590 --> 19:49.070
So I asked for permission
to expedite delivery.

19:50.870 --> 19:51.750
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

19:54.350 --> 19:55.870
I lacked judgment

19:56.510 --> 19:58.670
and became Xu Jingfu's blade in the end.

19:59.590 --> 20:00.430
To think...

20:01.390 --> 20:02.830
I let the souls of loyal men

20:04.150 --> 20:04.710
be wronged.

20:13.550 --> 20:14.110
Farewell.

20:42.360 --> 20:44.290
(Late Father Xiao Zhongwu,
Late Mother Song Wan)

20:44.500 --> 20:48.440
(Xiao Family Ancestral Hall)

21:24.030 --> 21:25.670
Ancestors of the Xiao family,

21:26.430 --> 21:28.270
the villain has been brought to justice.

21:28.990 --> 21:30.630
The grievances we have suffered

21:30.790 --> 21:31.750
are finally redressed.

21:33.670 --> 21:35.030
May all you heroic spirits

21:35.750 --> 21:36.470
rest in peace.

21:40.230 --> 21:41.990
Ancestors of the Xiao family,

21:42.550 --> 21:43.670
from now on, we will

21:44.270 --> 21:45.630
unite our efforts

21:46.390 --> 21:47.630
to uphold the family honor.

21:48.990 --> 21:50.550
And revitalize the Xiao Army.

22:20.070 --> 22:21.110
I once said

22:22.270 --> 22:23.430
that I had found

22:23.590 --> 22:24.590
my soulmate

22:25.550 --> 22:26.950
and promised to bring her here.

22:26.950 --> 22:27.990
(Late Father Xiao Zhongwu,
Late Mother Song Wan)

22:27.990 --> 22:29.310
I brought her here.

22:30.070 --> 22:31.470
She's standing right next to me.

22:32.830 --> 22:33.750
Her name is He Yan.

22:40.790 --> 22:41.670
General Xiao.

22:42.670 --> 22:44.070
(Late Father Xiao Zhongwu)
You gave me the Qinglang Sword

22:44.670 --> 22:45.950
at Xianchang Academy.

22:46.470 --> 22:47.470
Your inspiring words

22:48.030 --> 22:48.990
still echo in my ears.

22:49.790 --> 22:51.030
We've achieved our goal.

22:51.670 --> 22:52.350
And we will

22:52.990 --> 22:54.510
stay true to our aspirations.

22:56.270 --> 22:58.110
(Late Father, Late Mother)
General Xiao. Madam.

22:58.990 --> 22:59.910
Rest assured.

23:09.230 --> 23:10.630
I will take care of Huaijin.

23:19.510 --> 23:20.790
After the storm comes sunshine.

23:21.590 --> 23:23.390
It seems we'll celebrate a wedding soon.

23:31.630 --> 23:33.310
He impersonated General Feihong.

23:33.310 --> 23:34.550
Such audacity!

23:37.270 --> 23:38.630
(Notice: Treason)
They must die.

23:38.630 --> 23:39.510
Execute them.

23:40.150 --> 23:40.670
Deserved it!

23:40.690 --> 23:46.560
(Notice: He Rufei and Xu Jingfu's
Treason Charges)

24:02.230 --> 24:04.430
Sister, you came to see me?

24:06.590 --> 24:08.230
Are you here to mock my downfall?

24:09.590 --> 24:10.870
How dare you

24:11.390 --> 24:13.870
laugh at me, the general?

24:21.110 --> 24:21.710
He Yan.

24:22.390 --> 24:24.430
I ended up like this

24:24.950 --> 24:26.750
all because of you.

24:28.070 --> 24:29.030
Why is everyone

24:29.470 --> 24:31.830
outraged on your behalf?

24:32.590 --> 24:33.430
What about me?

24:37.710 --> 24:38.470
What about me?

24:40.670 --> 24:42.510
You stole my identity

24:42.870 --> 24:44.750
to go to the academy, join the army,

24:45.470 --> 24:46.910
and earn glory.

24:48.990 --> 24:49.750
If you weren't

24:49.830 --> 24:51.590
known as the He family's
legitimate heir,

24:51.950 --> 24:54.310
who would've recognized you?

24:54.590 --> 24:56.670
A caged canary from the inner chambers

24:56.830 --> 24:59.310
could never accomplish anything.

25:00.270 --> 25:01.150
But I

25:01.590 --> 25:03.310
am He Rufei.

25:03.990 --> 25:04.750
I am

25:05.350 --> 25:07.350
General Feihong.

25:12.070 --> 25:13.350
Why deceive yourself?

25:14.670 --> 25:16.110
He Yan got enlisted twice,

25:16.990 --> 25:18.750
starting as a rookie every time.

25:19.910 --> 25:20.670
She earned

25:21.150 --> 25:22.470
her glory through

25:22.670 --> 25:24.110
relentless training.

25:24.910 --> 25:25.710
She earned

25:26.390 --> 25:27.190
her glory

25:27.270 --> 25:28.910
by risking her life on the battlefield.

25:29.710 --> 25:31.430
You think she stole your thunder?

25:31.870 --> 25:32.870
Weren't you going about

25:33.590 --> 25:34.590
in the camp and court

25:35.510 --> 25:37.070
in that domineering manner

25:38.150 --> 25:39.910
thanks to her achievements?

25:43.390 --> 25:44.990
Nonsense!

25:46.550 --> 25:48.030
Who is she?

25:48.230 --> 25:50.030
She's just my substitute.

25:50.270 --> 25:51.630
Everything she possesses now

25:51.790 --> 25:54.270
rightfully belongs to me!

25:54.630 --> 25:55.350
Really?

25:56.230 --> 25:58.190
Then why don't you prove yourself

25:58.630 --> 25:59.710
and start over?

26:00.310 --> 26:02.550
Because you stole my life.

26:02.950 --> 26:04.790
You stole my identity.

26:05.190 --> 26:06.150
I've lost all chances.

26:06.350 --> 26:07.110
No.

26:07.110 --> 26:08.350
It's because you dare not.

26:08.990 --> 26:10.230
Nonsense.

26:10.350 --> 26:11.430
You don't have the guts.

26:13.070 --> 26:14.230
But I do.

26:15.430 --> 26:16.430
You keep saying that

26:16.590 --> 26:17.590
I've achieved everything

26:17.590 --> 26:18.870
by posing

26:19.190 --> 26:20.190
as He Rufei.

26:20.830 --> 26:22.350
But after that poisoned tea,

26:22.710 --> 26:24.270
the course of fate changed.

26:24.590 --> 26:25.870
My presence here today

26:26.630 --> 26:28.030
is the ultimate proof.

26:28.550 --> 26:29.710
Whether as He Rufei

26:29.750 --> 26:30.750
or He Yan,

26:31.110 --> 26:32.350
I'm here

26:33.230 --> 26:34.550
to tell you that

26:36.270 --> 26:37.990
regardless of my name

26:38.990 --> 26:40.430
or gender,

26:43.150 --> 26:44.110
I would always

26:45.030 --> 26:47.110
become General Feihong.

26:53.230 --> 26:53.910
Stop!

26:53.950 --> 26:54.790
Come back!

26:55.070 --> 26:56.430
Why are you leaving? Come back!

26:57.030 --> 26:58.150
Don't you want to kill me?

26:59.270 --> 27:00.910
Aren't you here to kill me?

27:01.070 --> 27:01.790
Do it!

27:02.310 --> 27:03.150
You're unworthy.

27:03.710 --> 27:05.390
You'll pay for your crimes.

27:06.150 --> 27:06.710
You will

27:06.710 --> 27:07.950
be executed in public

27:09.510 --> 27:10.670
and be condemned

27:11.350 --> 27:12.710
by all the Wei people.

27:13.790 --> 27:15.310
In the afterworld,

27:16.230 --> 27:17.510
countless fallen souls

27:17.550 --> 27:18.510
of Wei soldiers

27:19.430 --> 27:21.550
and the Xiao Army's warriors

27:22.430 --> 27:24.270
will deliver your final judgment.

27:29.670 --> 27:30.950
You think I'm scared?

27:31.950 --> 27:32.910
Get back here.

27:33.150 --> 27:34.430
That's my life.

27:34.550 --> 27:35.910
You owe me.

27:36.070 --> 27:37.830
They owe me!

27:38.150 --> 27:39.150
I am General Feihong.

27:39.470 --> 27:40.670
I am General Feihong.

27:40.830 --> 27:42.750
I am General Feihong!

27:43.030 --> 27:44.110
I am General Feihong.

27:45.110 --> 27:47.590
I am General Feihong.

27:49.070 --> 27:50.950
I am General Feihong.

27:55.470 --> 27:57.270
I am General Feihong. I...

28:03.760 --> 28:07.620
(Court of Judicial Review)

28:22.030 --> 28:22.670
Commander.

28:24.150 --> 28:25.670
Ambushing isn't honorable.

28:26.790 --> 28:27.590
All's fair in war.

28:35.150 --> 28:36.030
To me,

28:36.950 --> 28:37.630
you are just you.

28:38.470 --> 28:39.350
Beyond titles

28:40.230 --> 28:41.230
or names.

28:42.390 --> 28:43.870
That's how I feel about you, too.

28:56.550 --> 28:57.190
Miss He.

28:59.710 --> 29:00.510
Mr. Chu.

29:02.190 --> 29:02.950
Miss He.

29:03.310 --> 29:04.630
Why are you here?

29:05.350 --> 29:06.510
To visit an acquaintance.

29:11.030 --> 29:12.390
And why are you here, Mr. Chu?

29:15.030 --> 29:16.070
To see my master.

30:02.350 --> 30:02.990
Master,

30:03.750 --> 30:04.590
I'm here to visit.

30:18.990 --> 30:19.950
Zilan.

30:20.630 --> 30:22.510
All these years,

30:22.790 --> 30:25.430
I've been guiding you wholeheartedly

30:26.310 --> 30:27.670
and pouring resources

30:28.910 --> 30:31.070
into your career.

30:32.030 --> 30:35.550
How could you repay kindness

30:35.710 --> 30:37.550
with betrayal?

30:40.030 --> 30:40.950
You are mistaken.

30:41.950 --> 30:43.950
You have been nothing but nice to me.

30:44.790 --> 30:45.870
But when it comes

30:46.750 --> 30:48.590
to the interest of our nation,

30:48.750 --> 30:49.630
we both know

30:49.990 --> 30:51.270
what weighs more.

30:51.830 --> 30:52.910
You taught me to be loyal

30:53.150 --> 30:54.350
and to care for the people.

30:54.950 --> 30:55.910
And what happened?

30:57.310 --> 30:58.470
You have forgotten

30:59.350 --> 31:00.270
what you once

31:00.270 --> 31:01.550
taught me.

31:01.990 --> 31:03.750
As the Chancellor of Wei,

31:04.150 --> 31:06.270
you plotted treason
and framed loyal officials

31:06.270 --> 31:07.230
for personal gain.

31:07.550 --> 31:09.110
Therefore, I had no choice

31:09.710 --> 31:12.230
but to prioritize justice
over personal bonds.

31:19.310 --> 31:21.430
You ungrateful wretch

31:21.630 --> 31:23.710
and villainous traitor.

31:24.750 --> 31:26.230
How dare you frame

31:26.310 --> 31:29.390
such hypocrisy as noble speech?

31:29.790 --> 31:30.590
I shouldn't have

31:31.030 --> 31:33.470
dragged you out of your messy family

31:33.590 --> 31:36.470
just because you were talented.

31:37.230 --> 31:38.360
The truth has been revealed.

31:39.310 --> 31:39.910
Master,

31:39.910 --> 31:41.310
must you persist in your mistakes,

31:41.550 --> 31:42.470
plunging yourself

31:42.710 --> 31:44.070
into an abyss of ruin?

31:51.830 --> 31:53.030
Alright.

31:54.270 --> 31:56.990
You're truly my outstanding disciple,

31:58.790 --> 32:00.710
prioritizing self-preservation.

32:02.310 --> 32:05.670
The disciple surpasses the master.

32:08.670 --> 32:09.670
As your disciple,

32:11.750 --> 32:12.910
I've never sought

32:13.670 --> 32:14.870
to surpass you.

32:16.110 --> 32:17.590
I merely strive for

32:17.590 --> 32:18.510
a clear conscience.

32:20.390 --> 32:22.310
But between gratitude and my duties,

32:23.150 --> 32:24.310
for the nation

32:24.550 --> 32:25.710
and the people,

32:26.430 --> 32:27.350
I had no choice

32:27.950 --> 32:29.750
but to betray your nurturing grace.

32:42.390 --> 32:43.270
Enough.

32:44.030 --> 32:45.870
There is no turning back now.

32:56.910 --> 32:57.710
Zilan,

33:00.550 --> 33:03.030
I ask only one thing.

33:04.190 --> 33:05.870
Be nice to my daughter.

33:09.350 --> 33:10.390
Pingting

33:12.310 --> 33:16.150
genuinely likes you.

33:19.310 --> 33:20.870
Miss Xu may like me,

33:21.750 --> 33:23.510
but I've never returned her affections.

34:24.190 --> 34:25.590
But rest assured,

34:28.110 --> 34:29.590
I won't implicate the innocent.

34:51.280 --> 34:54.370
(Chu Mansion)

35:09.790 --> 35:11.110
Having known warmth,

35:12.390 --> 35:13.830
who would willingly let it go?

35:21.270 --> 35:21.790
They say

35:22.070 --> 35:23.190
you turned

35:23.550 --> 35:25.070
against my father in court.

35:26.030 --> 35:27.030
It's a lie.

35:27.070 --> 35:27.620
Right?

35:30.390 --> 35:31.110
It's true.

35:35.830 --> 35:36.430
That day,

35:37.270 --> 35:37.910
when you

35:37.950 --> 35:39.550
promised to save my father,

35:40.750 --> 35:41.830
were you lying to me?

35:45.710 --> 35:46.550
Chu Zhao.

35:47.310 --> 35:49.110
My father treated you so well.

35:49.390 --> 35:50.830
He was your master.

35:51.590 --> 35:53.550
How could you betray him?

35:56.070 --> 35:57.390
You imprudent maid!

36:01.510 --> 36:02.270
Miss Xu,

36:02.270 --> 36:03.350
you'd better behave.

36:03.830 --> 36:05.510
Or I wouldn't mind being more imprudent.

36:07.470 --> 36:08.830
How did I betray him?

36:11.350 --> 36:12.030
Pingting,

36:12.390 --> 36:13.590
he may have been

36:13.710 --> 36:14.910
a devoted father to you.

36:15.150 --> 36:16.110
But to Wei,

36:16.150 --> 36:17.910
he was an irredeemable traitor.

36:18.270 --> 36:19.230
Aiding him

36:19.470 --> 36:21.110
would make me a real traitor.

36:21.950 --> 36:22.510
Pingting,

36:23.310 --> 36:25.030
guard your words from now on

36:25.670 --> 36:26.950
lest you bring disaster.

36:27.750 --> 36:28.750
Nonsense.

36:44.830 --> 36:45.710
Now I get it.

36:47.510 --> 36:48.510
Now I get it.

36:53.230 --> 36:54.750
You never loved me.

36:55.830 --> 36:57.310
I was stupid enough to think

36:57.950 --> 36:59.590
my sincerity had touched you.

37:00.230 --> 37:00.910
Chu Zhao,

37:01.910 --> 37:04.030
have you ever spoken an honest sentence?

37:05.070 --> 37:06.470
You are simply

37:06.470 --> 37:08.230
an ungrateful wretch!

37:08.990 --> 37:09.550
Pingting,

37:10.350 --> 37:11.510
I promised your father

37:12.390 --> 37:13.510
to care for you.

37:14.150 --> 37:15.350
Rest assured and stay here.

37:16.030 --> 37:17.550
Who wants your pity?

37:20.630 --> 37:21.950
Escort Miss Xu back.

37:22.150 --> 37:22.710
Understood.

37:38.830 --> 37:40.390
Mr. Chu, you're truly talented,

37:40.490 --> 37:41.710
clearly chancellor material.

37:41.910 --> 37:42.910
You flatter me.

37:43.230 --> 37:45.150
Mr. Wei, you overestimate my worth.

37:49.830 --> 37:51.950
Appearance indeed transforms people.

37:52.670 --> 37:53.190
Not long ago,

37:53.190 --> 37:54.670
she was a soldier in Yezhou Garrison.

37:54.670 --> 37:55.750
Now, suddenly,

37:55.950 --> 37:57.070
she's become a general.

37:57.270 --> 37:58.550
With General Fengyun's help,

37:59.190 --> 38:00.470
her future is truly promising.

38:01.390 --> 38:02.710
She was always a general.

38:03.270 --> 38:04.550
As a gem obscured by dust,

38:05.030 --> 38:06.310
she needs no one's help.

38:07.790 --> 38:08.430
General Feihong.

38:09.430 --> 38:10.070
General Fengyun.

38:13.870 --> 38:15.190
I forgot to congratulate you.

38:15.670 --> 38:16.510
Let me make up now.

38:18.030 --> 38:18.710
To make up,

38:19.230 --> 38:20.430
empty words won't suffice.

38:20.870 --> 38:21.870
Your salary exceeds mine.

38:22.070 --> 38:23.950
You should treat me to a fine meal.

38:25.390 --> 38:26.550
You've made the request.

38:26.990 --> 38:28.870
We certainly shouldn't be stingy.

38:30.430 --> 38:32.030
The traitors were brought

38:32.950 --> 38:34.390
to justice largely with your help.

38:34.950 --> 38:35.470
Let us

38:35.990 --> 38:37.150
treat you to a feast someday.

38:38.670 --> 38:39.790
To dine with General Feihong

38:39.910 --> 38:41.350
and General Fengyun

38:41.790 --> 38:43.070
would be the greatest honor.

38:48.910 --> 38:50.510
The court assembly is about to start.

38:50.950 --> 38:52.270
Let's hurry to the hall.

38:52.750 --> 38:54.870
We're sending Maningbu away today.

38:55.430 --> 38:56.470
Let's show him

38:56.550 --> 38:58.150
the morale of us Wei officials.

39:13.270 --> 39:13.950
I received

39:14.590 --> 39:16.470
the alliance proposal
of the King of Wutuo.

39:16.830 --> 39:18.870
Since Wutuo shows such sincerity,

39:19.190 --> 39:19.990
we won't

39:20.430 --> 39:21.910
hold grudges against you.

39:22.190 --> 39:24.190
I will discuss with my ministers

39:24.270 --> 39:25.630
where to set up trade markets.

39:26.590 --> 39:27.590
Meanwhile, profits

39:28.110 --> 39:30.070
follow the agreed terms.

39:30.830 --> 39:32.790
Wei takes 70 percent,

39:33.230 --> 39:34.510
Wutuo 30.

39:34.910 --> 39:35.670
You may

39:36.110 --> 39:37.990
return assured, Envoy.

39:38.790 --> 39:41.470
Thank you, Your Majesty.

39:58.670 --> 40:00.830
Wutuo spared no expense

40:01.150 --> 40:02.390
to save Maningbu.

40:03.670 --> 40:04.470
His Majesty

40:04.790 --> 40:05.790
did that to dampen

40:05.790 --> 40:06.710
Wutuo's arrogance.

40:08.230 --> 40:09.230
Courtesy before force.

40:10.070 --> 40:12.070
As long as Wutuo doesn't invade,

40:12.590 --> 40:14.790
our army and people can take a break.

40:15.190 --> 40:15.910
Our people

40:16.070 --> 40:17.470
can live peacefully.

40:18.430 --> 40:20.110
But the Wutuo troops are cunning.

40:20.590 --> 40:21.630
We mustn't relax

40:21.910 --> 40:23.110
our military defenses.

40:23.470 --> 40:25.070
Stay prepared for all changes.

40:26.630 --> 40:27.950
Under war's shadow,

40:28.710 --> 40:30.310
people always suffer the most.

40:31.430 --> 40:32.710
If peace reigns,

40:33.910 --> 40:35.510
I'd gladly retire.

40:37.270 --> 40:39.190
But I intend to be a great general.

40:39.910 --> 40:40.670
How about this?

40:40.990 --> 40:42.030
I'll support you.

40:44.420 --> 40:46.580
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:46.680 --> 40:50.600
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:50.780 --> 40:52.720
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:52.820 --> 40:57.750
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

41:09.840 --> 41:11.250
♪I've seen the mountains♪

41:11.450 --> 41:12.870
♪And trodden through ice♪

41:13.130 --> 41:15.950
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

41:16.250 --> 41:17.650
♪Destiny is my creed♪

41:17.700 --> 41:19.100
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

41:19.250 --> 41:21.050
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

41:22.250 --> 41:23.720
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

41:23.890 --> 41:25.170
♪Gazing through the mire♪

41:25.350 --> 41:27.740
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

41:27.940 --> 41:29.990
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

41:31.130 --> 41:32.960
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

41:34.920 --> 41:37.840
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

41:37.930 --> 41:40.590
♪There must always be a longing♪

41:41.040 --> 41:46.110
